usage: demo [-h] [-v] [-n COUNT] [--ratio R] [--mode {fast,slow}] [-q]
            [--tag TAGS] [--point X Y]
            name [files ...]

Process some files.

positional arguments:
  name                the name
  files               input files

options:
  -h, --help          show this help message and exit
  -v, --verbose       more output
  -n, --count COUNT   repetitions (default: 1)
  --ratio R           a ratio
  --mode {fast,slow}  speed
  -q, --quiet         no output
  --tag TAGS          add a tag
  --point X Y         a point

Have fun.
